      "content": "makes sense. one more thing—we've had some issues with stuff getting contaminated or spoiling faster than it should even when we follow the logs. are there any specific \"invisible\" indicators or signs of early spoilage we should be looking for before we actually see visible rot or smell anything? just want to be extra cautious about those hard-to-detect issues.",
